entries[263449] = { ["name"] = "Fluffy Comfy Flying Quilt", ["text"] = "Binds to Warband\nUnique\nMount\n(Account-wide)\nUse: Teaches you how to summon this mount. This is a flying mount.\nSummons and dismisses this mount. This mount changes depending on your Riding skill and location.\nRequires level 1 to 90 ( 90)\nRequires Apprentice Riding\nSell Price:\n\"Woven together by some of the finest Dalaran mages, this flying quilt is known for its comfort and fluffy pillows.\"\nTrading Post" }
